{"xson":[{"/iati-activities/iati-activity":[{"/activity-date":[{"@iso-date":"2009-12-17","@type":"2"},{"@iso-date":"2020-09-30","@type":"4"}],"/activity-status@code":"4","/collaboration-type@code":"2","/contact-info":[{"/department/narrative":[{"1":"MCO-EGY","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/email":[{"1":"v.jijyan@ifad.org"}],"/job-title/narrative":[{"1":"Head MCO/Country Director","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/organisation/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/person-name/narrative":[{"1":"Jijyan, Vrej","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/telephone":[{"1":"+390654591"}],"/website":[{"1":"http://www.ifad.org"}],"@type":"1"}],"/default-aid-type":[{"@code":"C01","@vocabulary":"1"}],"/default-tied-status@code":"5","/description":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"The objective of the project is to improve the livelihoods of the target group through: (i) higher on-farm water use efficiency; (ii) improvements in agricultural productivity; (iii) marketing support for smallholders and the landless; and (iv) promoting employment and income generation by supporting small businesses and microenterprises (SBMs).The project will contribute to the capacity building of: (i) community-based organizations such as WUOs, community development associations (CDAs) and marketing associations (MAs); and (ii) public service providers, such as extension, research and irrigation services, and the SFD. Capacity building will take the form of training, technical assistance and knowledge sharing.","@xml:lang":"EN"}]}],"/document-link":[{"/category":[{"@code":"A12"}],"/description/narrative":[{"1":"More information on how IFAD publish IATI data to ensure the effectiveness of development.","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/language":[{"@code":"EN"}],"/title/narrative":[{"1":"IATI documentation on IFAD corporate website","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"@format":"TEXT/HTML","@url":"/en/iati"},{"/category":[{"@code":"A12"}],"/description/narrative":[{"1":"The IFAD website includes a specific page for this project.  More in